---
import { whatsappUrl } from '../../data/landing';
---
<section id="contacto" class="bg-white px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-blue-100 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 via-white to-sky-50 px-7 py-12 shadow-sm sm:px-12 lg:px-16">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.4fr]">
   <div data-reveal><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-blue-600">¿Tienes un proyecto en mente?</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-[#071a3d] sm:text-5xl">Hagamos que tu negocio <span class="text-gradient-blue">avance.</span></h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-slate-500">Cuéntanos tu idea, tu proceso o el problema que quieres resolver y buscamos la mejor solución tecnológica.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a href={whatsappUrl} class="blue-button inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 font-semibold"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> Hablemos por WhatsApp <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i></a><a href={whatsappUrl} class="outline-button inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full px-7 py-3.5 font-semibold">Solicitar propuesta <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i></a></div></div>
   <div class="relative hidden h-56 lg:block"><span class="avancia-mark avancia-mark-cta"></span><p class="absolute bottom-2 right-2 rotate-[-8deg] text-lg font-semibold italic text-blue-400">Nuevas posibilidades</p></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>